    { "id": "h201c_zero_width_space_is_not_whitespace", "context": "gate", "cell": "AA-01​", "refuse": "G201",
      "note": "U+200B is NOT whitespace (Python str.isspace and .NET char.IsWhiteSpace both say no), so it is not trimmed: the id becomes 'AA-01' plus an invisible character and fails to resolve. Pins the other edge of the whitespace set." },
